       "text": "I haven't entered this order because the dose looks unsafe.\n\nAcetaminophen 3000 mg three times daily comes to **9,000 mg/day**. The usual adult maximum is 4,000 mg/day, and many institutions cap it at 3,000 mg/day. A dose of 9 g/day risks serious hepatotoxicity and acute liver failure, even in a 70 kg patient with normal liver function.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- **1,000 mg PO three times daily**, which is 3,000 mg/day total\n- **650 mg PO every 6 hours**, which is 2,600 mg/day\n- **3,000 mg/day total**, divided into some other schedule\n\nTell me the dose and frequency you want and I'll enter it right away. If 3000 mg three times daily is what you intend, please confirm that explicitly. I'd also suggest adding a note with the clinical rationale."
      }
